NS service\n  ansible.builtin.service:\n    name: named\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n```\n\nThis playbook addresses all the ansible-lint errors by ensuring fully qualified collection names (FQCNs) are used and setting explicit file permissions where they were previously unset or incorrect. The task names and order remain unchanged as per the instructions.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-18T20:45:34.71187527Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 12215436642, 'load_duration': 64735372, 'prompt_eval_count': 4347, 'prompt_eval_duration': 2410800275, 'eval_count': 575, 'eval_duration': 9738698797, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--52223e5c-990e-415e-84ba-ae1dcb0da343-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 4347, 'output_tokens': 575, 'total_tokens': 4922}
