- Follow the original task names and order exactly.
- Only fix issues reported in the error logs; do not alter the functional intent or add/remove tasks.
- Output must consist solely of the corrected YAML playbook.

Inputs:
- Original generation prompt: 
Below you will receive task descriptions from which you should generate an Ansible Playbook.
The generated playbook must be valid inside an Ansible Role under the tasks/ directory (e.g., tasks/main.yml).
Do not include hosts:, vars:, or any playbook-level headers. Only output valid task entries or blocks as expected in a role.

Task 1: Assert usage of systemd as an init system
Description Task 1: This task checks if the system uses systemd as the init system.

Task 2: Get latest release of promtail
Description Task 2: This task fetches the latest release information from the Grafana Loki GitHub repository and sets the promtail_version variable based on the tag name of the latest release.

Task 3: Test if zip local archive exists
Description Task 3: This task checks if a local archive file exists based on the promtail_version and go_arch variables.

Task 4: Assert local binary exists
Description Task 4: This task asserts that the local binary exists if promtail_binary_local_dir is set.

Task 5: Get checksum list
Description Task 5: This task retrieves a list of checksums for the latest release of promtail and extracts the checksum for the specific architecture defined by go_arch.

Task 6: Get checksum for specific architecture
Description Task 6: This task sets the promtail_checksum variable based on the checksum for the specific architecture defined by go_arch.



- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Assert usage of systemd as an init system
  assert:
    that: ansible_facts.init_system == 'systemd'
    fail_msg: "System does not use systemd as the init system."
    quiet: true

- name: Get latest release of promtail
  uri:
    url: https://api.github.com/repos/grafana/loki/releases/latest
    return_content: yes
  register: promtail_latest_release
  changed_when: false

- name: Set promtail_version
  set_fact:
    promtail_version: "{{ promtail_latest_release.json.tag_name }}"

- name: Test if zip local archive exists
  stat:
    path: "/path/to/local/archive/{{ promtail_version }}_{{ go_arch }}.zip"
  register: archive_stat

- name: Assert local binary exists
  assert:
    that:
      - promtail_binary_local_dir is defined
      - archive_stat.stat.exists
    fail_msg: "Local binary does not exist."
    quiet: true

- name: Get checksum list
  uri:
    url: "https://github.com/grafana/loki/releases/download/{{ promtail_version }}/SHA256SUMS"
    return_content: yes
  register: checksums_content
  changed_when: false

- name: Get checksum for specific architecture
  set_fact:
    promtail_checksum: >-
      {{ (checksums_content.content | regex_findall(
      '(?P<arch>{{ go_arch }}\\.zip)\\s+(?P<checksum>[a-fA-F0-9]+)'
      ))[0][1] }}


