content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  include_tasks: assert.yml\n\n- name: Install required packages\n  package:\n    name: "{{ selinux_requirements }}"\n    state: present\n  notify: Gather facts\n\n- name: Flush handlers\n  meta: flush_handlers\n\n- name: Conditionally configure SELinux\n  when: selinux_status and ansible_connection == \'ssh\'\n  block:\n    - name: Manage selinux\n      selinux:\n        state: "{{ selinux_state }}"\n        policy: "{{ selinux_policy }}"\n      notify: Reboot\n\n    - name: Manage selinux booleans\n      seboolean:\n        name: "{{ item.name }}"\n        state: "{{ item.state }}"\n        persistent: "{{ item.persistent }}"\n      loop: "{{ selinux_booleans }}"\n      loop_control:\n        label: "{{ item.name }}"\n```\n\nThis playbook fulfills the task requirements by including the specified tasks in the exact order and using the specified module calls and conditions. It is structured for inclusion in an Ansible Role under the `tasks/main.yml` file.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-18T22:41:42.85008787Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 3670782054, 'load_duration': 57582677, 'prompt_eval_count': 511, 'prompt_eval_duration': 50288292, 'eval_count': 220, 'eval_duration': 3561636171, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--92ca92b3-2151-4eea-a87d-b08df99dc0bd-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 511, 'output_tokens': 220, 'total_tokens': 731}
